# Format:
# type(scope): short imperative summary
#
# Examples:
# feat(core): bound the turn stream at 1024 events
# fix(claude): treat a missing stream-json result as a vendor error
# docs(compliance): quote the Codex app-server integration note
#
# Types:
# feat, fix, refactor, perf, docs, test, chore, ci, build, deps, release
#
# Scopes:
# core, claude, codex, acp, mea, fixtures, docs, ci, build, deps, release


#
# Rules:
# - Write in English
# - Use imperative mood
# - Keep subject <= 72 chars
# - No trailing period
# - One concern per commit
# - Cite the vendor doc a harness change follows
#
# What, why, validation (if applicable) and refs (if applicable)
# -
